<OmiFixPdf Fix="FIX.4.4">

  <!--
  Aquis Stock Exchange FIX Market Data Technical Specification, Quotes &amp; Trade Capture Reports, v1.0.5
  (April 2024). The tables print Tag, Field Name, Req'd and Comments, with no type column: each field takes
  its FIX 4.4 type from the FIX 4.4 dictionary the declaration composes (Fix.Version), the protocol the
  document says the feeds use (1). Tags the FIX 4.4 dictionary does not define (1134, 5997, 5998, 20311 and
  the MMT tags 6001 - 6050) state no type, as printed. The header and trailer are FIX 4.4's (Fix.Headers)
  -->

